{"availability":"available","full":"Harikishanth/HealBee-AI","name":"HealBee-AI","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":8,"forks":1,"created":"2026-01-31T04:20:44Z","updated":"2026-02-15T08:33:57Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://healbee-ai.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:41.290Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:41.290Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:41.290Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T05:50:41.290Z","stars":8,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A voice-based, multilingual AI health companion for accessible healthcare information.","HealBee is a web application that acts as a friendly, voice-enabled health companion. Users can ask health-related questions, describe symptoms, or seek wellness guidance in multiple Indian languages—via text or voice—and receive clear, contextual, and safety-aware responses. The app runs in the browser (Streamlit) and can optionally remember the user (login, chat history, profile) when Supabase is configured.","HealBee is not a medical device, does not diagnose or prescribe, and is not a substitute for a doctor. It is a first point of contact for general health information and awareness, especially where language or access to information is a barrier."],"features":["Voice + text input in 8 Indian languages (English, हिन्दी, தமிழ், മലയാളം, తెలుగు, ಕನ್ನಡ, मराठी, বাংলা).","AI-powered understanding and answers (Sarvam-M), with strict no-diagnosis, no-prescription guardrails.","Interactive Symptom Checker that asks follow-up questions and gives preliminary, triage-style guidance—never a diagnosis.","Optional login to save chats and a simple health profile for more relevant, continuous conversations.","Maps: search by city/locality; in Chatbot, nearby hospitals/clinics by GPS (within 10 km), tailored to your concern and shown in your chosen chat language."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Harikishanth/HealBee-AI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0745ec14957804f273cd17f2f45dbe34b81c6c5bac4699ca6ee2e94782604518","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:41.468Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:41.468Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A voice-based, multilingual AI health companion for accessible healthcare information.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Harikishanth/HealBee-AI/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"The app runs in the browser (Streamlit) and can optionally remember the user (login, chat history, profile) when Supabase is configured.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Harikishanth/HealBee-AI/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"Optional login to save chats and a simple health profile for more relevant, continuous conversations.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Harikishanth/HealBee-AI/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"not_required","text":"No paid Google API is required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Harikishanth/HealBee-AI/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"0745ec14957804f273cd17f2f45dbe34b81c6c5bac4699ca6ee2e94782604518","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Harikishanth/HealBee-AI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:41.469Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-02-15T08:33:57Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Harikishanth/HealBee-AI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:41.471Z","hash":"0745ec14957804f273cd17f2f45dbe34b81c6c5bac4699ca6ee2e94782604518","originalBytes":27027,"storedBytes":27027,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["user","supabase","language","chat","app","e.g.","symptom","when","nlu","health","journal","reminders","profile","healbee","nearby","optional","safety","streamlit","voice","src","chatbot","maps","clinics","hospitals","auth","sarvam","sarvam-m